ient_msg_id":"42950658-ed89-43b5-aa7e-d2b0bf8e98b8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"but now だと一度否定してるので、そこですっぱり切り替わってる感覚がある","ts":"1615852140.045400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TGKL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8ca0a7f-ecb0-4bdd-9805-e0304c75b953","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"言ってること伝わるかな","ts":"1615852118.044900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5kx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45d125a6-b16a-4b22-af99-f05ba4f4a581","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"At first ~からグラデーションして言ってる感じ","ts":"1615852114.044700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"idhP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5f94232-28cb-487d-8aaf-d9de6814679f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"beginning to 過去からの変化が含まれる\nbut now        今現在の状態のみ\nって言う感じ","ts":"1615852087.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GRsH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25a7261a-06e3-41fc-837a-9ce6f5e9e0a6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"それまでの過程は↓じゃないすか？\nAt first I didn’t like my job,","ts":"1615852086.043800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Skxx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7e7ab11-70b8-4312-b6dd-855f1523af46","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"けど、but now だと、それまでの過程がない気がする","ts":"1615852040.042800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=jFP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c9a4581-71be-4510-a86f-88f93326b670","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あと、beginning toなので、最近のイメージがある\n最近楽しみ始めるようになった","ts":"1615852024.042400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MUh"}]},{"client_msg_id"